        <characteristic name="Description" characteristicTypeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" value="Melee weapon: Melee, S+2, AP4, causes 2 total wounds. An unmodified hit roll of 6 causes 2 mortal wounds instead and ends the attack sequence. Replaces one melee weapon."/>
