        <characteristic name="Description" characteristicTypeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" value="Select one bolt weapon the bearer is equipped with: improve its Multiple Wounds tier by 1 step and its AP by 1 tier; it wounds automatically against any unit it has already damaged this battle."/>
