        <characteristic name="Description" characteristicTypeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228" value="If the bearer is a Character, attacks against it suffer -1 to hit. If not, attacks against its unit from more than 12&quot; away suffer -1 to hit."/>
